@fn lookup
@purpose Resolve a name from `scope_id` by walking the parent chain up to universe.
@post Returns the Symbol on hit; sentinel (name="") on miss. [src: scope.aria:161-172]
@complexity O(D) parent-chain depth. [src: scope.aria:157-172]
@thread_safety immutable read.

