@fn lookup_local
@purpose Search a specific scope only — does NOT walk parents.
@complexity O(S) where S = symbols in that scope (linear scan; no hash map). [src: scope.aria:142-154]
@antipatterns Do not use for shadowing detection — use lookup(). [src: resolver.aria:169]

