@fn _add_sym
@purpose Register a symbol in the current scope with duplicate-declaration checking.
@pre Symbol name not already in scope, OR symbol kind is SkVariant. [src: resolver.aria:148-160]
@post Symbol added; E0702 on duplicate (except variants). [src: resolver.aria:161-163]
@complexity O(S) via lookup_local. [src: resolver.aria:149]
@antipatterns Do not call for modules from use-decls — use the dedicated pass-1 token scan. [src: resolver.aria:2590-2630]

