@fn _add_sym_warn_shadow
@purpose Register with an ancestor-scope shadowing warning (except for builtins).
@post Symbol added; W0004 if the name exists in any ancestor scope and is not a builtin. [src: resolver.aria:174-178]
@complexity O(D) parent-chain via lookup. [src: resolver.aria:169]
@antipatterns Do not use for top-level decls — no shadowing warning is wanted there. [src: resolver.aria:167]

