@fn _push_scope / _pop_scope
@purpose Manage the current-scope pointer; _push creates a child, _pop restores the parent.
@complexity O(1) each. [src: resolver.aria:183-191]
@antipatterns Unbalanced push/pop leaves orphan scopes; popping the universe scope is invalid.

