@purpose Resolve a token identifier by name; emit E0701 with a stdlib-module or similar-name suggestion on miss.
@pre Current token is IDENT. [src: resolver.aria:1649]
@post Resolved or error logged with suggestion; closure-capture detection runs (detection only, no action). [src: resolver.aria:1668-1699]
@complexity O(D + E) lookup + edit-distance suggestion. [src: resolver.aria:1650-1653]
@antipatterns Cross-file visibility checks — disabled by design in bootstrap. [src: resolver.aria:1686-1697]

